    "notes": "Lift Mon / Wed / Fri · Run Tue / Thu / Sat · Sun rest.\n• If Tuesday was speed or interval work and your legs feel flat, cut deadlifts to 2 sets or swap them for Romanian deadlifts.\n• Add weight to the main lifts only when you complete all reps with good form and your runs feel good.",
